#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:209
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{o}_t$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:209
msgid "输出门输出"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:209
#, python-brace-format
msgid "决定了 $\\mathbf{c}_t$ 中哪些维度应出现在 $\\mathbf{h}_t$ 中"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:232
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**$\\mathbf{h}_t$ 的生成——两步走**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:234
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**第一步**：$\\tanh(\\mathbf{c}_t)$——将细胞状态压缩到 $(-1, 1)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:236
msgid "这一步有两个作用："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:238
#, python-brace-format
msgid "防止输出值过大（$\\mathbf{c}_t$ 中的值理论上可以无限增长，因为遗忘门允许 $f_t=1$ 的累积）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:239
msgid "将记忆归一化到标准范围，方便后续层处理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:241
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**第二步**：$\\mathbf{o}_t \\odot \\tanh(\\mathbf{c}_t)$——选择性暴露"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:243
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf{o}_t$ 像一个\"发言人\"，它基于当前需要（$\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}$ 和 "
"$\\mathbf{x}_t$）决定：记忆中的哪些部分应该体现在当前输出中。比如，当预测下一个词是动词时，输出门可能重点暴露记忆中关于\"动作\"的维度，而压抑关于\"形容词\"的维度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:246
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**直觉**：你拥有完整的长期记忆 "
"$\\mathbf{c}_t$（整本书的内容），但当别人问你\"刚才讲了什么\"时，你只会说出与当前问题相关的部分。这个\"根据当前需要筛选发言内容\"的过程，就是"
" $\\mathbf{o}_t$ 在做的事。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:249
msgid "完整更新公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:251
msgid "把四个角色组合在一起，LSTM 的一步更新为："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "LSTM 完整公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:256
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**门控计算**（所有门共享相同的输入 $[\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}, \\mathbf{x}_t]$）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:258
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathbf{f}_t &= \\sigma(\\mathbf{W}_f \\cdot [\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}, "
"\\mathbf{x}_t] + \\mathbf{b}_f) \\quad &\\text{遗忘门} \\\\\n"
"\\mathbf{i}_t &= \\sigma(\\mathbf{W}_i \\cdot [\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}, "
"\\mathbf{x}_t] + \\mathbf{b}_i) \\quad &\\text{输入门} \\\\\n"
"\\tilde{\\mathbf{c}}_t &= \\tanh(\\mathbf{W}_c \\cdot [\\mathbf{h}_{t-1},"
" \\mathbf{x}_t] + \\mathbf{b}_c) \\quad &\\text{候选记忆} \\\\\n"
"\\mathbf{o}_t &= \\sigma(\\mathbf{W}_o \\cdot [\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}, "
"\\mathbf{x}_t] + \\mathbf{b}_o) \\quad &\\text{输出门}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:267
msgid "**状态更新**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:269
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathbf{c}_t &= \\mathbf{f}_t \\odot \\mathbf{c}_{t-1} + \\mathbf{i}_t "
"\\odot \\tilde{\\mathbf{c}}_t \\quad &\\text{记忆更新} \\\\\n"
"\\mathbf{h}_t &= \\mathbf{o}_t \\odot \\tanh(\\mathbf{c}_t) \\quad "
"&\\text{对外输出}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:276
msgid "其中 $\\odot$ 表示逐元素乘法（Hadamard 积）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:279
msgid ""
"**记忆更新公式详解**：$\\mathbf{c}_t = \\mathbf{f}_t \\odot \\mathbf{c}_{t-1} + "
"\\mathbf{i}_t \\odot \\tilde{\\mathbf{c}}_t$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "项"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "直觉"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{f}_t \\odot \\mathbf{c}_{t-1}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "遗忘门 × 旧记忆"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "**保留部分**——旧记忆中通过遗忘门筛选后留下的"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "$\\mathbf{i}_t \\odot \\tilde{\\mathbf{c}}_t$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "输入门 × 候选新信息"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "**新增部分**——候选信息中通过输入门批准写入的"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "$+$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "逐元素加法"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:253
msgid "新旧混编——记忆的更新是\"删掉一些旧的，添加一些新的\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:287
msgid "读作：**新记忆 = 旧记忆中保留下的 + 新信息中被批准写入的**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:295
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"LSTM 内部的门控结构。信息沿顶部的水平线（细胞状态 $\\mathbf{c}_t$）流动——$\\times$ 表示门控的逐元素乘法，$+$ "
"表示新旧信息的合并。图片来自 Chris Olah 的博客 \"[Understanding LSTM "
"Networks](https://colah.github.io/posts/2015-08-Understanding-"
"LSTMs/)\"——深度学习领域最经典的可视化之一。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:299
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**四类参数的规模**：设隐状态维度为 $d$，输入维度为 $m$。每个门都是一个 $\\mathbb{R}^{d+m} \\to "
"\\mathbb{R}^d$ 的线性映射，参数量为 $d \\times (d+m) + d$。四个门总计 $4d(d+m+1)$ "
"个参数。对于一个 $d=256$、$m=128$ 的 LSTM，约为 $4 \\times 256 \\times 385 \\approx "
"394,240$ 个参数——是同等 RNN 的 4 倍，但换来了可控的长期记忆。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:304
msgid "为什么LSTM能缓解梯度消失：梯度高速公路"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:306
msgid ""
"回顾 {ref}`gradient-vanishing` 中的分析：梯度消失的根源是 Jacobian 连乘。RNN "
"中，$\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{h}_t}{\\partial \\mathbf{h}_{t-1}}$ 包含 "
"$\\tanh$ 的导数，它始终 $\\leq 1$，连乘后指数衰减。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:308
#, python-brace-format
msgid "LSTM 的关键差异在于**细胞状态 $\\mathbf{c}_t$ 的梯度路径**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:310
msgid ""
"对 $\\mathbf{c}_t = \\mathbf{f}_t \\odot \\mathbf{c}_{t-1} + \\mathbf{i}_t"
" \\odot \\tilde{\\mathbf{c}}_t$ 求导："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:312
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{c}_t}{\\partial \\mathbf{c}_{t-1}} = "
"\\mathbf{f}_t \\quad \\text{（对角矩阵，每个维度独立）}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:316
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**核心洞察**：$\\mathbf{c}_{t-1}$ 对 $\\mathbf{c}_t$ 的梯度就是遗忘门 $\\mathbf{f}_t$ "
"本身——**没有 $\\tanh$，没有复杂的非线性**。如果 $\\mathbf{f}_t \\approx "
"1$（网络选择\"保留\"），梯度几乎无损地穿过这一时间步。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:318
msgid "类比：传送带 vs 搅拌机"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:321
msgid "**RNN**：信息每步都经过 $\\tanh$ 的\"搅拌\"——100 步后，原始内容面目全非，梯度也一样"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:322
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**LSTM**：信息在一条**传送带**（$\\mathbf{c}_t$）上流动。遗忘门 $\\mathbf{f}_t$ "
"只在传送带上打开小的\"丢弃口\"——大部分东西原封不动地通过。梯度也沿这条传送带几乎无损地回传"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:324
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这与 {ref}`res-net` 中 $\\mathbf{x} + F(\\mathbf{x})$ "
"的设计哲学完全一致：**让梯度有一条不经过非线性的捷径**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:327
msgid "RNN vs LSTM 梯度传播对比"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:333
msgid "梯度路径"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:334
msgid ""
"$\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{h}_t}{\\partial \\mathbf{h}_{t-1}}$ 包含 "
"$\\tanh'$，始终 $\\leq 1$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:335
msgid ""
"$\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{c}_t}{\\partial \\mathbf{c}_{t-1}} = "
"\\mathbf{f}_t$，可接近 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:336
msgid "100步后梯度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:337
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\approx 0.5^{100} \\approx 10^{-31}$（消失）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:338
#, python-brace-format
msgid "若 $\\mathbf{f}_t \\approx 1$，梯度几乎不变"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:339
msgid "能否学到千步依赖"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:340
msgid "几乎不可能"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:341
msgid "理论上可以（实践中困难但可行）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:344
msgid "LSTM 仍有局限"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:346
msgid "LSTM 解决了梯度消失，但没有解决所有问题："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:348
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**仍是串行处理**：$\\mathbf{h}_t$ 必须等 $\\mathbf{h}_{t-1}$ 算完。序列长度 1000 意味着 1000 "
"次串行计算，无法并行训练"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:349
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**固定尺寸的瓶颈**：所有历史信息必须压缩进一个固定维度的 "
"$\\mathbf{c}_t$。序列越长，压缩越有损——就像把一本书总结成一段话，总有信息丢失"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:350
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**门控也会饱和**：当 $\\mathbf{f}_t$ 在训练中饱和为 0（网络学会了\"这段必须忘掉\"），梯度仍然会切断——只是比 RNN "
"更可控"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:353
msgid ""
"LSTM 的贡献不是\"解决了所有问题\"，而是**把问题的维度降低了**：从\"梯度指数衰减到 "
"0\"变成\"网络可以通过学习门控来调控梯度流动\"。这为深度学习处理序列打开了大门——此后 20 年里，LSTM 是 NLP "
"领域的主力架构，直到 Transformer 出现。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:356
msgid "代码实践：LSTM 的梯度保持能力"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/lstm.md:358
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import torch\n"
"import torch.nn as nn\n"
"\n"
"# RNN: 参数量 = W_h(64×64) + W_x(64×32) + b(64) + W_y(64×32) = 8,256\n"
"rnn = nn.RNN(input_size=32, hidden_size=64, num_layers=1)\n"
"\n"
"# LSTM: 四个门，每个门 = W(64×96) + b(64) = 6,208\n"
"#       四个门总计 = 24,832（约RNN的3倍）\n"
"#       外加输出投影权重不计入（PyTorch默认不自动回归输出）\n"
"lstm = nn.LSTM(input_size=32, hidden_size=64, num_layers=1)\n"
"\n"
"# 长序列测试——100步，梯度必须穿越100次门控操作\n"
"x = torch.randn(100, 1, 32)  # (seq_len=100, batch=1, features=32)\n"
"\n"
"# RNN前向——隐状态 h_t 每一步经过 {ref}`lstm-gradient-highway` 中描述的 tanh 压缩\n"
"rnn_out, _ = rnn(x)          # rnn_out: (100, 1, 64)\n"
"rnn_out[-1].sum().backward()  # 只对最后一步求梯度\n"
"# 查看输入权重的梯度范数——由于梯度消失（{ref}`gradient-vanishing`），接近0\n"
"print(f\"RNN   W_ih grad norm: {rnn.weight_ih_l0.grad.norm():.10f}\")\n"
"\n"
"# LSTM前向——输出 (output, (h_n, c_n))\n"
"#   output: (100, 1, 64) ——每一步的隐状态（对外输出）\n"
"#   h_n:    (  1, 1, 64) ——最后一步的隐状态\n"
"#   c_n:    (  1, 1, 64) ——最后一步的细胞状态（长期记忆）\n"
"lstm_out, (h_n, c_n) = lstm(x)\n"
"lstm_out[-1].sum().backward()\n"
"# LSTM的输入权重梯度显著更大——遗忘门 f_t 为梯度保留了通路（{ref}`lstm-gradient-highway`）\n"
"print(f\"LSTM  W_ih grad norm: {lstm.weight_ih_l0.grad.norm():.10f}\")\n"
"# 典型输出：LSTM的梯度范数比RNN大2-3个数量级\n"
msgstr ""

